#~ msgid ""
#~ "             The Story:\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Yet again, the fate of the world rests\n"
#~ "in your hands!  An evil computer hacker,\n"
#~ "known only by his handle 'Bill', has\n"
#~ "created the ultimate computer virus.  A\n"
#~ "virus so powerful that it has the power\n"
#~ "to transmute an ordinary computer into\n"
#~ "a toaster oven.  (oooh!) 'Bill' has\n"
#~ "cloned himself into a billion-jillion\n"
#~ "micro-Bills.  Their sole purpose is to\n"
#~ "deliver the nefarious virus, which has\n"
#~ "been cleverly diguised as a popular\n"
#~ "operating system.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "As System Administrator/Exterminator,\n"
#~ "your job is to keep Bill from succeeding\n"
#~ "at his task."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "             Zgodba:\n"
#~ "Ponovno je usoda sveta v vaših rokah!\n"
#~ "Zlobni računalniški heker, ki je znan le\n"
#~ "po svojem psevdonimu 'Bill', je ustvaril\n"
#~ "nadmočen računalniški virus. Virus je\n"
#~ "tako močan, da je sposoben vsak \n"
#~ "navaden računalnik spremeniti v\n"
#~ "toaster (uuuu!) 'Bill' je sebe kloniral\n"
#~ "v milijarde mikro-Billov. Njihov edini\n"
#~ "namen je, da dostavijo virus, ki je\n"
#~ "spretno zamaskiran kot popularen\n"
#~ "operacijski sistem.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Vaša naloga je, da kot sistemski\n"
#~ "administrator preprečite Billu,\n"
#~ "da bi uresničil svoje namene."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "             The Rules:\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "xBill has been painstakingly designed and\n"
#~ "researched in order to make it as easy to use\n"
#~ "for the whole family as it is for little Sally.\n"
#~ "Years - nay - days of beta testing and \n"
#~ "consulting with the cheapest of human interface\n"
#~ "designers have resulted in a game that is easy\n"
#~ "to use, yet nothing at all like a Macintosh.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "I.   Whack the Bills (click)\n"
#~ "II.  Restart the computer (click)\n"
#~ "III. Pick up stolen OSes & return(drag)\n"
#~ "     them to their respective computers\n"
#~ "IV.  Drag the bucket to extinguish sparks\n"
#~ "V.   Scoring is based on total uptime,\n"
#~ "     with bonuses for killing Bills.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "As for the rest, you can probably figure\n"
#~ "it out.  We did, so it can't be too hard."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "             Pravila:\n"
#~ "xBill je bil ustvarjen in raziskan tako, da bi bil\n"
#~ " karseda najmanj boleč za uporabo celi družini,\n"
#~ "tako kot za malo Špelco.\n"
#~ " Igra, ki je enostavna za uporabo (tako kot Macintosh), je plod "
#~ "dolgoletnega - večdnevnega beta testiranja in\n"
#~ "posvetovanja z najcenejšimi ustvarjalci uporabniškega vmesnika\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "I.   Speštaj Bille (klik)\n"
#~ "II.  Resetiraj računalnike (klik)\n"
#~ "III. Poberi ukradene OSje in jih vrni       ustreznim računalnikom "
#~ "(povleci)\n"
#~ "IV.  Povlecite vedro, da pogasite iskre. V.   Točkovanje bazira na "
#~ "porabljenem času in\n"
#~ "       bonusih za pobite Bille.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Ostalo boste verjetno ugotovili sami.\n"
#~ "Nam je uspelo, zato ne bi smelo biti pretežko."

